\**Optional**: Activate the {p:Records of Eminence} 15th Vana'versary V objective __* (W)__ for sparks and experience.
=2 Walkthrough
* This Limit break only applies to {p:jobs|Jobs} before the {p:Treasures of Aht Urhgan} expansion.

:* See the {p:Limit Break} page for the jobs after this expansion. The {p:Jobs} page lists this jobs as well.

* Speak to {p:Maat} on any level 66-70 {p:Job}. He will ask you bring a {p:testimony|Category:Job Testimony} for your job to him.
* Click on a Testimony below for details on what monsters drop them and how to find the monsters.

|^~c3~{@i:War. Testimony|1426} Testimonies
|{i:Warrior's Testimony|War. Testimony|1426}|{i:Monk's Testimony|Mnk. Testimony|1427}|{i:White Mage's Testimony|Whm. Testimony|1428}
|{i:Black Mage's Testimony|Blm. Testimony|1429}|{i:Red Mage's Testimony|Rdm. Testimony|1430}|{i:Thief's Testimony|Thf. Testimony|1431}
|{i:Paladin's Testimony|Pld. Testimony|1432}|{i:Dark Knight's Testimony|Drk. Testimony|1433}|{i:Beastmaster's Testimony|Bst. Testimony|1434}
|{i:Bard's Testimony|Brd. Testimony|1435}|{i:Ranger's Testimony|Rng. Testimony|1436}|{i:Samurai's Testimony|Sam. Testimony|1437}
|{i:Ninja's Testimony|Nin. Testimony|1438}|{i:Dragoon's Testimony|Drg. Testimony|1439}|{i:Summoner's Testimony|Smn. Testimony|1440}

* Once you trade the testimony to Maat, he will ask if you are ready.

:* If you say yes, he will teleport you to an BCNM arena. *as of 2026, if this is not your 1st Maat fight/win it doesn't appear as though he will warp you to the BCNM when you trade the testimony.
:* Trade the Testimony to Burning Circle to enter a one-on-one battle against Maat.
:* Testimonies may be used up to __three__ times before they tear and are unusable. You must then obtain a new testimony to attempt the fight again.

* If you are rematching Maat on a job that is not your first, keep in mind that each job has an 'assigned' BCNM location, and you will be unable to enter the fight by trading the testimony to a Burning Circle other than your 'assigned' one.

:* The assigned locations are as follows:
:* {z:Balga's Dais} - MNK/WHM/SMN
:* {z:Horlais Peak} - WAR/BLM/RNG
:* {z:Qu'Bia Arena} - PLD/DRK/BRD
:* {z:Waughroon Shrine} - RDM/THF/BST
:* {z:Chamber of Oracles} - SAM/NIN/DRG

* The time limit is __10 minutes__, but after about 5 minutes from engaging Maat, he will begin to use {p:Asuran Fists}. This tends to hurt much more than his other moves.
* Your {p:Support Job} will be removed when you enter the battlefield, therefore you will lose all buffs (except for food) and TP.

:* Maat's main job will be set to yours and his Support Job seems to be Monk, and can use all Hand-to-Hand weapon skills.
:* Maat will posses all the relevant abilities and spells of your main job, including your {@g:Two-Hour ability|Two-Hour ability} special ability.

* If you have the {k:"Rhapsody in Umber"} {@k} Key Item, you are able to summon {p:Trust Magic} to aid you.

:* This key item is obtainable through {M:Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Missions|Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Missions|Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Missions} around level 55+.

* To win, you must either get Maat's HP close to 0 or satisfy a special condition for certain jobs.

:* Special secondary win conditions include only the following jobs:

::* **{p:White Mage}** may instead pull Maat then stay alive for 5 min, causing Maat to give up.
::* **{p:Thief}** may try to steal a {i:Scroll of Instant Warp|Instant Warp|4181} from Maat. Once you steal the item, Maat will give up.

:::* **Note**: If you possess one already, you will not be able to steal another.

* When Maat gives up, you will receive the title __"Maat Masher"__ and a {i:Scroll of Instant Warp|Instant Warp|4181}.
* Return to {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} and speak to Maat to complete the quest. *as of 2026 he doesn't appear to have post-win dialogue other than when you get your 6th win to get the trust and when you get your Maat's cap.

\**Note**: You keep your testimony after the fight. If you have not yet gained access to {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} via the quest {q:The Road to Aht Urhgan|The Road to Aht Urhgan|The Road to Aht Urhgan} you may trade your testimony afterwards under the __advanced path__ option and complete the quest.
